# Handoff

When finishing a phase (only after `./scripts/check-phase-clear.sh` exits 0):

1. Update `docs/HANDOFF.md` — short checklist, read order, “you are Phase N only”.
2. Keep or refresh `docs/CURSOR_HANDOFF_PROMPT.md` as the self-contained next-agent brief.
3. Point to phase docs under `docs/phases/`.
4. State what not to do (no skipping human gates; no COMPLETE without the gate script).
5. Confirm dual VCS, macOS-only, and MyKAIA long-term principle still apply.